00:03:17.433 --> 00:03:19.267
But mostly we'll focus on

00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:22.833
how this simplicity, efficiency,
adaptability, and reliability

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.667
can be applied to a variety
of cellular workflows,

00:03:25.733 --> 00:03:28.933
