Obviously, we're available for
additional information

00:51:15.067 --> 00:51:17.067
when it comes to cellular workflows,

00:51:17.133 --> 00:51:20.067
or my colleagues have presented on
some genomic workflows as well.

00:51:20.133 --> 00:51:24.367
This is just one aspect of what
you can do with automation

00:51:24.433 --> 00:51:26.600
and what you can do with
the Biomek i-Series,

00:51:26.667 --> 00:51:31.400
so we're happy to always provide more
